        Root cause:<Root cause>

    You are a programming expert.
    You will be given the root cause of a bug and  the corresponding patch.
    You need to extract the code statements that lead to the bug from  the patch, based on the root cause.


    Provide a response strictly in the following format:
    Code statements:
    <text1>
    <text2>
    <text3>
    <text4>
    ...
    <textN>

Root cause:
The bug was caused by using the incorrect engine ID when signaling a semaphore in the Intel graphics driver. The code was using `waiter->id` instead of the correct `waiter->hw_id`, which led to improper targeting of the semaphore signal. This mismatch arose due to the introduction of a distinct engine ID (`engine->id`) that differed from the hardware ID (`engine->hw_id`), necessitating the fix to ensure the correct hardware ID is used for semaphore signaling.
